OL,3,GNEWSAMum's plea to find son who
OL,4,Adisappeared aged 15 as his 40th
OL,5,Abirthday approaches
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe mother of a teenager who was last
OL,8,Fseen at a house party when he was 15
OL,9,Fhas made an appeal for information
OL,10,Fahead of what would have been his 40th
OL,11,Fbirthday.
OL,13,FRobert Williams went missing from his
OL,14,Fhome in Resolven, Neath, on 22 March
OL,15,F2002.
OL,17,FIt is known that Robert went to a party
OL,18,Fin nearby Aberdulais the following day,
OL,19,Fbut despite multiple police appeals he
OL,20,Fhas never been found.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,437,430,260,140,0,100
